        "semanticLevel": "detail",
        "content": {
          "kind": "html",
          "value": "<div style='min-height:100%;box-sizing:border-box;background:#ffffff;font-family:system-ui'><header data-role='masthead' style='padding:48px 40px 20px'><div style='font:800 12px/1 system-ui;letter-spacing:.18em;color:#7c3aed;margin-bottom:14px'>EDGE CLASS · landing-surface</div><h1 style='margin:0 0 12px;font:850 40px/1.05 system-ui;color:#0f172a'>Landing surface</h1><p style='margin:0;max-width:44ch;font:400 19px/1.5 system-ui;color:#475569'>Where the graph lands when it is opened.</p></header><section data-role='preview' style='padding:8px 40px 24px'><svg style='width:100%;height:auto;display:block;border-radius:18px' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' viewBox='0 0 760 460'><rect width='760' height='460' rx='24' fill='#0f172a'/><text x='30' y='48' fill='#f8fafc' font-family='system-ui' font-size='25' font-weight='700'>Landing surface</text><text x='30' y='76' fill='#a5b4fc' font-family='system-ui' font-size='12' font-weight='400'>landing-surface</text><text x='30' y='108' fill='#cbd5e1' font-family='system-ui' font-size='15' font-weight='400'>Where the graph lands when it is opened.</text><circle cx='106' cy='255' r='19' fill='#0ea5e9'/><circle cx='654' cy='255' r='19' fill='#fb7185'/><path d='M130 255 C296.66666666666663 199 463.33333333333337 311 630 255' fill='none' stroke='#3f6212' stroke-width='8' stroke-linecap='round' stroke-linejoin='round' opacity='1'/><path d='M130 255 C296.66666666666663 199 463.33333333333337 311 630 255' fill='none' stroke='#d9f99d' stroke-width='3' stroke-linecap='round' stroke-linejoin='round' opacity='1'/><path d='M639 255 L625 247 L625 263 Z' fill='#d9f99d'/><rect x='305' y='280' width='150' height='34' rx='17' fill='#111827' stroke='#8b5cf6' stroke-width='2'/><text x='380' y='303' text-anchor='middle' fill='#f5f3ff' font-family='system-ui' font-size='13' font-weight='700'>Landing surface</text><text x='38' y='352' fill='#7dd3fc' font-family='system-ui' font-size='13' font-weight='600'>FROM  declaration, port</text><text x='394' y='352' fill='#fda4af' font-family='system-ui' font-size='13' font-weight='600'>TO  Any node</text><text x='38' y='390' fill='#cbd5e1' font-family='system-ui' font-size='13' font-weight='400'>TYPE  reference</text><text x='394' y='390' fill='#cbd5e1' font-family='system-ui' font-size='13' font-weight='400'>ROUTE  curved</text><text x='38' y='426' fill='#cbd5e1' font-family='system-ui' font-size='13' font-weight='400'>PAINT  2 strokes</text><text x='394' y='426' fill='#cbd5e1' font-family='system-ui' font-size='13' font-weight='400'>ARROW  end</text></svg></section><section data-role='settings' style='padding:24px 40px'><h2 style='margin:0 0 12px;font:800 26px/1.2 system-ui;color:#0f172a'>Settings</h2><dl style='margin:0;max-width:560px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:max-content 1fr;gap:8px 24px;padding:18px 22px;border-radius:14px;background:#f8fafc;border:1px solid #e2e8f0'><dt style='font:700 13px/1.5 system-ui;color:#64748b'>Key</dt><dd style='margin:0;font:500 15px/1.5 system-ui;color:#0f172a'>landing-surface</dd><dt style='font:700 13px/1.5 system-ui;color:#64748b'>Label</dt><dd style='margin:0;font:500 15px/1.5 system-ui;color:#0f172a'>Landing surface</dd><dt style='font:700 13px/1.5 system-ui;color:#64748b'>Default edge type</dt><dd style='margin:0;font:500 15px/1.5 system-ui;color:#0f172a'>reference</dd><dt style='font:700 13px/1.5 system-ui;color:#64748b'>Route</dt><dd style='margin:0;font:500 15px/1.5 system-ui;color:#0f172a'>curved</dd><dt style='font:700 13px/1.5 system-ui;color:#64748b'>Arrow</dt><dd style='margin:0;font:500 15px/1.5 system-ui;color:#0f172a'>end</dd><dt style='font:700 13px/1.5 system-ui;color:#64748b'>From</dt><dd style='margin:0;font:500 15px/1.5 system-ui;color:#0f172a'>declaration, port</dd><dt style='font:700 13px/1.5 system-ui;color:#64748b'>To</dt><dd style='margin:0;font:500 15px/1.5 system-ui;color:#0f172a'>Any node</dd><dt style='font:700 13px/1.5 system-ui;color:#64748b'>Connection rule</dt><dd style='margin:0;font:500 15px/1.5 system-ui;color:#0f172a'>From declaration, port to any node. At most 1 from one node. The editor refuses any other connection.</dd><dt style='font:700 13px/1.5 system-ui;color:#64748b'>Strokes</dt><dd style='margin:0;font:500 15px/1.5 system-ui;color:#0f172a'>2 painted</dd></dl></section><section data-role='section' style='padding:24px 40px'><h2 style='margin:0 0 12px;font:800 26px/1.2 system-ui;color:#0f172a'>Description and rationale</h2><p style='margin:0 0 12px;max-width:60ch;font:400 16px/1.6 system-ui;color:#334155'>The place a graph opens onto: the node that holds what a visitor should see first. It is usually a Content node, but a collection lands on its root Port and an idea graph on an idea, so it names no target kind. A Declaration or a Port has one.</p><p style='margin:0 0 12px;max-width:60ch;font:400 16px/1.6 system-ui;color:#334155'>The graph validator already refused a second landing surface with a rule of its own. This class states the same rule where every other edge rule lives.</p></section><section data-role='section' style='padding:24px 40px'><h2 style='margin:0 0 12px;font:800 26px/1.2 system-ui;color:#0f172a'>Evidence</h2><p style='margin:0 0 12px;max-width:60ch;font:400 16px/1.6 system-ui;color:#334155'>Validated as LANDING_SURFACE_MULTIPLE in components/GraphEditor/validators/validateGraphInvariants.js, and drawn from the Declaration&apos;s landing-surface port.</p></section></div>"
        },
