        "body": "The place a graph opens onto: the node that holds what a visitor should see first. It is usually a Content node, but a collection lands on its root Port and an idea graph on an idea, so it names no target kind. A Declaration or a Port has one.\n\nThe graph validator already refused a second landing surface with a rule of its own. This class states the same rule where every other edge rule lives.",
